    <!-- Font Awesome -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.1.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">
            <h1>Shoe<span>s</span></h1>
        </div>

        <ul>
            <li><a href="index.ejs">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="products.ejs">Products</a></li>
            <li><a href="about.ejs">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="review.ejs">Review</a></li>
            <li><a href="services.ejs">Services</a></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="icons">
            <!-- <i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i> -->
            <button onclick="window.location.href='login.ejs'" style="background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="about" id="About">
        <h1>Web<span>About</span></h1>

        <div class="about_main">
            <div class="about_image">
                <div class="about_small_image">
                    <img src="/image/red_shoes1.png" onclick="changeImage(this)">
                    <img src="/image/red_shoes2.png" onclick="changeImage(this)">
                    <img src="/image/red_shoes3.png" onclick="changeImage(this)">
                    <img src="/image/red_shoes4.png" onclick="changeImage(this)">
                </div>

                <div class="image_contaner">
                    <img src="/image/red_shoes1.png" id="imagebox">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="about_text">
           <p>
    Contrary to popular belief, premium footwear is not simply about appearance. The art of shoemaking has roots in ancient 
    civilizations dating back over 4000 years. Our master cobblers at StepUp Footwear have studied these timeless techniques, 
    combining them with modern technology to create exceptional shoes. Just as the Romans developed specialized sandals for 
    different terrains and statuses, we craft distinct collections for every lifestyle and occasion.
    
    The philosophy behind our designs comes from centuries of footwear evolution - from the earliest leather wrappings to 
    today's performance sneakers. Each pair in our collection represents this heritage while incorporating contemporary 
    comfort technologies. The foundation of proper foot support was established in Renaissance Europe, where shoemaking 
    became a respected craft. We honor this tradition while innovating for modern needs.
    
    Like the carefully selected materials in historical ceremonial footwear, we source only the finest leathers and textiles. 
    Our manufacturing process follows the same attention to detail that made 15th century Italian shoes prized possessions. 
    The standard of quality we maintain today builds upon these age-old principles of craftsmanship, now enhanced with 
    biomechanical research and sustainable practices.
</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <a href="products.ejs" class="about_btn">Shop Now</a>
    </div>

    <script>
        function changeImage(small) {
            const full = document.getElementById("imagebox");
            full.src = small.src;
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
